{"nodes": [{"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_11_02_ui_polish_design_design_ui_polish", "label": "Design: ui-polish", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-02-ui-polish/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_11_02_ui_polish_design_value_button_edit_input", "label": "View mode real <button>, edit mode real <input>", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-02-ui-polish/design.md", "source_location": "L38", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No input exists outside edit mode, so no caret, I-beam or phone keyboard can appear; a readonly input styled as text still focuses and draws a caret in some engines."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_11_02_ui_polish_design_cursor_by_inheritance", "label": "Cursor by inheritance: html cursor default, auto on inputs and data-prose", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-02-ui-polish/design.md", "source_location": "L43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One rule instead of cursor: default on dozens of chrome selectors; global user-select:none rejected because it hides the symptom and breaks copying prose."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_11_02_ui_polish_design_morph_shape_via_pseudo_elements", "label": "Morph shape via ::view-transition-group(*.cover) pseudo-elements", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-02-ui-polish/design.md", "source_location": "L46", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Corners came from .card overflow:hidden which is not part of the snapshot; styling the group with --r-card, overflow clip and --shadow-float fixes radius and shadow pop; per-transition <style> is the fallback if